# Voice engine model files (fetched at build time, never committed). The directory's SOURCE
# files are tracked: ignoring the whole directory hid routing.py from git (found 2026-11-06
# when a Workbench worktree's suite failed to import it).
# (the global "models/" rule above also hides it, so the directory is un-ignored first and its
# contents re-ignored; only the two source files come through)
!backend/models/
backend/models/*
!backend/models/__init__.py
!backend/models/routing.py

# Enrolled face gallery - biometric data, local only, never committed
backend/data/faces/

# Workbench worktrees (ADR 0027): proposals are drafted and tested here, never in the live checkout
.workbench/
